        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evalaimu nũthatĩtye ũthatu wĩ woo mũno: kwondũ wa ũu nthakame yake ĩkatiwa ĩũlũ wake, na kĩvũthya kyake Mwĩaĩi wake akamũtũngĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
